  "text": "CUCA AI Robot Sales & Wellness Franchise Platform\nCUCA AI ROBOT\nHome\nAbout\nProducts\nRental Hosting\nAgents\nFranchise\nServices\nAccount\nAI Staff\n文A\nEnglish\n▾\nLogin\nRegister\nJoin Now\nAI Robot Sales · Rental Hosting · Franchise · 3-Level Distribution\nCUCA AI Robot Sales & Wellness Center Global Business Platform\n\nCUCA builds a platform for AI robot sales, rental hosting, wellness franchise stores, agent networks, membership, 3-level distribution, profit-sharing and AI-powered marketing staff.\n\nBecome an Agent\nProduct Mall\nRental Hosting\n3-Level\nDistribution\n3 Tiers\nAgent System\n3 Stores\nFranchise Types\nAI Staff\nAI Agents\n🤖\nAI Customer Service\nOnline\nAgent Website\nAuto Build\nRental Hosting\nActive\nProfit Sharing\nAuto\nAI Robot Product Center\n\nSales, agency, rental, hosting and store deployment.\n\n🤖\nAI Massage Robot\n\nCommercial wellness edition — buy, rent or host.\n\nFrom SGD 20,000\n🔥\nAI Moxibustion Robot\n\nSmart temperature control and standardized therapy.\n\nFrom SGD 20,000\n🩺\nAI Health Screening Robot\n\nMember profiling, health assessment and AI reports.\n\nFrom SGD 6,800\n🏬\nWellness Center Package\n\nDevices, membership, AI customer service & marketing.\n\nFrom SGD 28,800\nView Product Mall\n3-Tier Agent System\n\nRegional, City and National agents — a scalable platform replication system.\n\nTeam Expansion\nRegional Agent\nUSD 100,000\n\n100,000 bonus shares — regional recruitment, team expansion, website and AI staff.\n\nLocal Market\nCity Agent\nUSD 500,000\n\n500,000 bonus shares — develop stores, hosting and regional agents.\n\nStrategic Partner\nNational Agent\nUSD 1,000,000\n\n2,000,000 bonus shares — build national HQ and nationwide expansion.\n\nView Agent Expansion System\nRental Hosting + 3-Level Distribution + Profit Sharing\n\nCustomers can buy or rent robots and host them in stores. The platform automatically calculates distribution and profit sharing.\n\n🇨🇳\nChina\n🇸🇬\nSingapore\n🇲🇾\nMalaysia\n🇭🇰\nHong Kong\n🇹🇭\nThailand\n🇮🇩\nIndonesia\n🇵🇭\nPhilippines\n1\nBuy/Rent\n\nChoose sales, rental or hosting plans.\n\n2\nHosting\n\nDeploy devices to wellness centers.\n\n3\nRevenue\n\nTrial cards, memberships and wellness services.\n\n4\n3-Level\n\nReferrer, team and agent earnings.\n\n5\nAuto Payout\n\nSettle by orders, devices and stores.\n\nChoose Hosting Plan\nAI Wellness Center Franchise\n\nStartup, standard and operation center stores for entrepreneurs and agent teams at every stage.\n\nS\nStartup Store\n\nSmall footprint, light assets, community entry.\n\n1–2 robots\nAI customer service\nMembership system\nMarketing assets\nT\nStandard Store\n\nIdeal for community chains and stable operations.\n\n3–5 robots\nExperience zone\nMember reception\nCommunity marketing\nO\nOperation Center\n\nDesigned for city and regional agents.\n\nShowroom\nTraining room\nLive streaming studio\nAgent incubation system\nView Franchise Center\nAI Agent Staff Marketing\n\nEvery agent can hire their own AI staff to connect social media and acquire customers automatically.\n\nCS\nAI Customer Service\n\n24/7 automated customer support for products, rental, franchise and agent policies.\n\nSA\nAI Sales Agent\n\nAuto-generates sales scripts, follow-ups and closing plans.\n\nVC\nAI Video Creator\n\nCreates short video scripts, social posts, live scripts and recruitment content.\n\nCM\nAI Community Manager\n\nManages WhatsApp, Telegram, WeChat and Facebook communities.\n\nLH\nAI Live Host\n\nAssists live recruitment, product demos and franchise briefings.\n\nFR\nAI Franchise Recruiter\n\nScreens prospects and auto-pushes agent and store partnership plans.\n\nOne-Click Agent Website Builder\n\nAgents auto-generate personal sales websites with QR codes, AI customer service, product videos, social media matrix and lead tracking.\n\nBuild My Site\nView Dashboard\ncuca.ai/sg/agent-steven\nPersonal Agent Website\nAI Customer Service Connected\nAI customer service connected\nTikTok · YouTube · Facebook · Instagram · WhatsApp\nSocial media matrix\nVideo Promotion Center\n\nProduct demos, recruitment videos, agent training and franchise promotion — all in one place.\n\nBusiness Opportunity Video\n\nExplains the AI robot trend, CUCA platform model, agent earnings and franchise value.\n\nGet Video\nAgent Training Video\n\nHelps agents master product demos, rental hosting, 3-level distribution and sales workflows.\n\nDashboard\nPlatform Dashboard Preview\n\nHQ, agents, members and stores each have role-based dashboard access.\n\nCUCA Admin\nOverview\nAgents\nMembers\nRental\nDistribution\nFranchise\nAI Staff\nWebsites\nLeads Today\n286\nHosting Orders\n48\nProfit Sharing\n$36,820\nAgent\nTier\nSource\nStatus\nSteven SG\nCity Agent\nTikTok\nFollowing up\nJohor Team\nRegional Agent\nAgent Website\nClosed\nMalaysia Partner\nNational Agent\nAI Customer Service\nNegotiating\nCommunity Store\nStandard Store\nWhatsApp\nPending\nJoin CUCA AI Robot Business Platform\n\nApply to become an agent, request rental hosting or franchise an AI wellness center.\n\nBecome an Agent\n\nFor entrepreneurs, team leaders and resource partners.\n\nApply\nRental Hosting\n\nRent or host robots and create revenue with the platform and stores.\n\nApply\nFranchise Store\n\nStartup, standard and operation center — replicate fast with one system.\n\nApply\n💬\nCUCA AI ROBOT\n\nAI robot sales, rental hosting, wellness franchise and AI-powered marketing platform.\n\nPlatform\n\nRobot Products\nAgent System\nMembership\n3-Level Distribution\n\nFranchise\n\nStartup Store\nStandard Store\nOperation Center\nRental Hosting\n\nAI Marketing\n\nAI Customer Service\nAI Sales\nAI Video\nSocial Media Matrix",
